title: '(? un-actionable) origin idea : human devel & quantum eval'
pid: 73d2161b-8ca4-42ef-b679-5557b7036a21
body: |2-
  As a person is formed, their consciousness and the
  (quantum, random) determination of which universe they are in
  evolve in tandem.

  One has, of course, already mostly undergone that process by
  adulthood: one (seems to?) have a good idea of what the world is.

  The implications for how to treat others are not obvious.
  That we all landed in this same universe bonds us;
  perhaps we all think (along some dimension(s)) alike.
